 <h3><u>Zakhm e akbar pe laila rida daal do</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haye Akbar haaye Akbar..(3)</p> 
  <p>Keh rahe the ye roro ke sarwar<br> zakhm e Akbar pe Laila ridaa daaldo</p> 
  <p>Mera farzand Hai khoon mein tarr..(2)<br> zakhm e Akbar pe Laila ridaa daaldo</p> 
  <p>1) Zakhm se is qadar khoo'n bahaa hai<br> khoon e akbar se tarr karbala hai<br> Naiza e zulm ki loriyo se<br> Laadla Mera soyaa huwa hai</p> 
  <p>Koi isko jagaade na aakar<br> zakhm e Akbar pe Laila ridaa daaldo</p> 
  <p>2) Haath me khoo'n ki mehndi lagaalo<br> Bass tasawwur me doolha banaalo<br> Tumne maanii hai jo zindagi bhar<br> Mannate aaj saari badhaalo</p> 
  <p>Gurbato ka ye sehra sajaakar<br> zakhm e Akbar pe Laila ridaa daaldo</p> 
  <p>3) Meri behno ko kab ye pataa Hai<br> Wo samajhtii Hai ye sorahaa Hai<br> Sard Hai jism saakit Hai nabzein<br> Mera kadiyal jawaa marchukaa Hai</p> 
  <p>Haath seene se iskaa hataakar<br> zakhm e Akbar pe Laila ridaa daaldo</p> 
  <p>4) Ghum ki kaalii ghataa chaa rahii Hai<br> Mujhko ye baat tadpaa rahii Hai<br> Pardaa saidaaniyo ka luteyga<br> Shaam e gurbat qareeb aarahii Hai</p> 
  <p>Phir mayassar kahaa hogi chaadar<br> zakhm e Akbar pe Laila ridaa daaldo</p> 
  <p>5) Khaak me milgaya hai wo baano<br> Jisko mitti bhi lagne na dii ho<br> Kitne naazo se paala tha usne<br> zakhm jaldii se bibi chupaado</p> 
  <p>Binte zehra na dekhe ye manzar<br> zakhm e Akbar pe Laila ridaa daaldo</p> 
  <p>6) Haaye meri sakina ki gurbat<br> Kaise dekhegi bhai ki mayyat<br> Do janaaze na uth'tenge mujhse<br> Wo to zindaan kii hai amaanat</p> 
  <p>Marna jaaye kahii Meri dukhtarr<br> zakhm e Akbar pe Laila ridaa daaldo</p> 
  <p>7) Usko ye kehke dena dilaasa<br> Tuu ne dekha na bhai ka laasha<br> Teri jaanib se maadar ne leykin<br> Bekafan ko kafan dediyaa Tha</p> 
  <p>Naam beemaar sughra ka leykar<br> zakhm e Akbar pe Laila ridaa daaldo</p> 
  <p>8) Aye hilaal ek mehshar bapaa tha<br> Khaima e shaah maatam kadaa tha<br> Ashq aankho se paiham rawaa the<br> Aal e Ahmad me shor e bukaa tha</p> 
  <p>Jab ye kehte the sibt e payambar<br> zakhm e Akbar pe Laila ridaa daaldo</p> 
  <p>Keh rahe the ye roro ke sarwar<br> zakhm e Akbar pe Laila ridaa daaldo</p> 
